#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. こ、こんな物…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on. I\n"
"just wanna...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…あり得ませんな、常識的に考えて！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...Nope! Can't do it. Think, man! Think!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>...Không! Không ổn đâu. Nghĩ, nào! Suy nghĩ đi!\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>監視カメラ…
#. きっと今も、この向こうで黒幕が…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Even now...on the other side of this camera, the\n"
"mastermind...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、それももうすぐ終わりだ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But that's gonna come to an end soon enough!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0005 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0006 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>体育館から出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the gym?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>Rời khỏi phòng thể dục?\n"
"<CLT>"
